			)
			(property "Package" "DCK / SC70-5, 5-pin, 2.00 x 1.25 mm body. Pinout taken from TI datasheet SNVSA40B Table 4-1 - NOT cloned from any other TPS611xx. Footprint Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-353_SC-70-5 is the JEDEC MO-203 / JEITA ED-7500A generic pattern: pads 1.025 x 0.35 at 1.675 mm centre span vs TI DCK0005A example 0.95 x 0.4 at 1.25 mm centre span, same 0.65 pitch. Class A leaded package under the hybrid policy, so classified VERIFIED_IPC_ALTERNATE, not vendor-exact."
				(at 0 0 0)
