			)
		)
		(property "Package" "Molex 5025700893 microSD push-push connector, 1.10 mm pitch, normal-mount SMT, front entry, shielded, with independent mechanical card-detect switch. Logical pins 1-11 per exact-part CAD C429846. Pin 9 SHIELD/EH is ONE logical pin carried on FOUR physical shell lands in the footprint - deliberate, do not renumber. Pin 10 DET-SW is the switched detect signal; pin 11 is the DETECT LEVER which Molex SD-502570-001 labels Vss:GROUND, so it is a second ground terminal distinct from pin 6. MECHANICAL CARD DETECT - ACTIVE LOW ON CARD INSERTION - NO BETA GPIO ALLOCATED - DO NOT ROUTE UNTIL PIN-MAP REVISION. CD/DAT3 (pin 2) is the SD data line used as SD_CS_N in SPI mode and is NOT the mechanical switch. DAT1 and DAT2 are unused in 1-bit SPI mode."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
