		(property "Description" "TI TPS22950C: 5.5 V, 3.2 A, 34 mOhm adjustable current-limited load switch. VIN 1.8-5.5 V. ILIM 0.5-3.5 A set by R_ILIM (ILIM = 1.18 x R[kOhm]^-1.072). ALWAYS-ON reverse current blocking. Auto-retry overcurrent response. Thermal shutdown 170 C. Open-drain FLT asserts on THERMAL SHUTDOWN and REVERSE CURRENT ONLY - a plain current-limit event leaves FLT Hi-Z. 500 kOhm smart pull-down on ON, but the datasheet still requires an external pull-down. DDC SOT-23-thin 6-pin."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
