			(property "Package" "50-contact 0.5 mm pitch FPC tail, mates with Hirose FH69-50S-0.5SH. All 50 physical contacts represented; pin numbering and names transcribed from SPEC-CH280QV10-CT_Rev.D pages 6-7. TFT driver ILI9341V. Touch controller identity is VERIFY - panel datasheet says CST026, Adafruit material says FT6236/FT6236U-compatible; only the physical I2C/IRQ/RESET interface is locked. Panel FPC tail thickness is not stated in the datasheet - VERIFY it is 0.30 +/-0.05 mm against Hirose FH69 before procurement."
